      "text": "𝐀𝐘𝐎 𝐀𝐌𝐌𝐁, 𝐌𝐀𝐊𝐄 𝐒𝐎𝐌𝐄 𝐍𝐎𝐈𝐒𝐄! 💥\n\nCARATS, we’re officially a few hours away before we officially begin and experience Love Note! ❤️\n\nCurious about what’s in store for you at this fan night? 👀\n\nGet ready for:\n🛍️ Merchant booths filled with cute and scrumptious finds you won’t want to miss!\n\n💌 A message board where you can leave something sweet for our February babies\n\n🎮 Fun games & giveaways\n\n🏁 A stamp rally to complete before you head HOME\n\nSee you very, very soon at Love Note. 💋\n\n🗓 February 28, 2026 \n🕑 02:00 PM onwards \n📍 Sun Garden, 5th Floor, Ayala Malls Manila Bay\n\nPROUDLY PRESENTED BY: @cbtlph \n\nBROUGHT TO YOU BY @cnaphils & IDIM DIY Bakery\n\nHOSTED BY: @vernonlineph_ & @dinonaraph\n\n#LoveNoteFromDKVernonDino\n#AtTheBay \n#FanNightsAtAMManilaBay\n#DK #VERNON #DINO",
